# Agent Behavior

Before coding, read `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `0_docs/STATUS.md`, and `0_docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`. Preserve the research chain and do not jump ahead. Every new file needs a description in the nearest README and `0_docs/FILE_CATALOG.md`. Filesystem create/move/delete/rename operations must be logged in `0_docs/operation_log.md`.

Never fabricate results. Keep Markdown frontmatter valid. Use clear English or Chinese comments for EEG-specific decisions.
